@BankSystem.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5243

### Login
POST {{BankSystem.API_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "your-username",
  "password": "your-password"
}

### Refresh the access and refresh tokens
POST {{BankSystem.API_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "refresh-token-from-login-or-last-refresh"
}

### Logout from this login session
POST {{BankSystem.API_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "current-refresh-token"
}

###
GET {{BankSystem.API_HostAddress}}/api/User/Count
Accept: application/json

### View the most recent login attempts (requires full-access permission)
GET {{BankSystem.API_HostAddress}}/api/Registration/LoginAttempts?take=50
Accept: application/json

###
